WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.497
<v Ayane>Ayane：Hi everyone, sorry to keep you waiting~!

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.692
<v Ayane>Ayane：…Huh? You're already here?

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.549
<v Ayane>Ayane：Ehehe, I'm so happy. Today is a special fan meeting just for you!

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.101
<v Ayane>Ayane：Hello… from this ear.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.850
<v Ayane>Ayane：(haa…)

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.294
<v Ayane>Ayane：And hello from this side too~!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.040
<v Ayane>Ayane：Hey hey… I'll tell you a secret. Just you.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.950
<v Ayane>Ayane：Actually… I was super nervous about today's stage.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.040
<v Ayane>Ayane：But when I saw your face… I forgot all about it.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.150
<v Ayane>Ayane：Hehe.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.359
<v Ayane>Ayane：So today, I'll sing just for you!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.750
<v Ayane>Ayane：…It's our secret, okay?

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.550
<v Ayane>Ayane：Ehehe.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.654
<v Ayane>Ayane：Phew… the stage lights are kinda hot.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.390
<v Ayane>Ayane：I know! Let me fan you!

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.103
<v Ayane>Ayane：Flap, flap~ Nice and cool?

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.806
<v Ayane>Ayane：This side too, flap, flap~

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.589
<v Ayane>Ayane：And then… ta-da! An ice-cold drink!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.274
<v Ayane>Ayane：Here you go. …Hear that clink? Nice, right?

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:19.743
<v Ayane>Ayane：Next… a game! Guess which side I'll talk from!

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.550
<v Ayane>Ayane：…Right side ♪

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.335
<v Ayane>Ayane：Oh, that breeze just now… secret magic!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.338
<v Ayane>Ayane：Next… left.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.609
<v Ayane>Ayane：Hehe, does it tickle?

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.750
<v Ayane>Ayane：Right…

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.650
<v Ayane>Ayane：(fuu~)

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:40.950
<v Ayane>Ayane：Left!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.100
<v Ayane>Ayane：Did you get them all? You're amazing!

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:48.567
<v Ayane>Ayane：And now… a mini live, just for you!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.079
<v Ayane>Ayane：Twinkling, shining, under the stars

00:01:55.100 --> 00:02:00.510
<v Ayane>Ayane：A secret with you, just us two

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.097
<v Ayane>Ayane：My heart won't stop racing

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:09.809
<v Ayane>Ayane：This feeling — reach you

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.360
<v Ayane>Ayane：…Ehehe, thanks for listening.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.669
<v Ayane>Ayane：Thank you so much… for coming today.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.565
<v Ayane>Ayane：Come see me again. …Promise.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.250
<v Ayane>Ayane：Bye-bye~!
